SwiftTransGUI
=============

This entire codebase — Swift/SwiftUI sources, build scripts, tests and
documentation — was rewritten entirely by the AI language model
MiMo-V2.6-Flash (model ID: mimo-v2.6-flash) without human programming
input.

The user interface and user experience are modeled on Transmission Remote
GUI (https://github.com/transmission-remote-gui/transgui), which is
Copyright (c) 2008-2019 Yury Sidorov and the Transmission Remote GUI
working group, licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2 or
later. No source code from that project was reused; only its UI strings,
layout and workflow were mirrored, with an original Swift/SwiftUI
architecture.

